      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比我预想的还要快很～多……\n就在那场“川崎纪念”里。",
      "source_fingerprint": "174ea142c63561eaf9384b2a733f2a40e720d56fe8796cad8b505df357440724",
