      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──“川崎纪念”。\n为了追上醒目飞鹰，\n用尽活力去挑战的，充满回忆的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f79bd8a2517700d271f156e41b850ea3ee8c0ae9aed54948a9e845325123f2b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
